# Third-party notices

## Waveshare ESP32-S3-RLCD-4.2 demo

`src/display.cpp` carries the ST7305 initialisation sequence and the landscape
framebuffer layout from the vendor demo package:

- https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-RLCD-4.2 (Apache License 2.0)
- original file: `01_Arduino/examples/09_LVGL_V9_Test/display_bsp.cpp`

Modifications: ported from `esp_lcd_panel_io_spi` to Arduino `SPI`, the
framebuffer packing moved to `src/st7305.cpp` so it can be unit-tested on the
host, and the pixel LUT was replaced with the closed-form `CellFor()`.

Apache License 2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

